type: software
title: "namd-aggregation-md: NAMD workflow for small-molecule self-assembly"
abstract: "Preparation, pre-flight checks, resume helpers and post-analysis for NAMD small-molecule self-assembly simulations: aggregate size, shape, composition and radial density for any solute, plus optional stacking geometry (J/H, slip angle, interplanar distance) for aromatic systems."
